  "instructions": [
    "Heat the clay tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the olive oil and sauté the onions until softened.",
    "Add the garlic, chili peppers, cumin, coriander, and paprika. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the pilchards and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the tomatoes and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the tagine and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro if desired."
